	(text "FAIL-SAFE ACTIVE DISCHARGE, INHIBITED WHILE THE CONTACTOR IS CLOSED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 497.604 167.064 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "031f77c2-9dd5-5940-9de1-856a175f6c78")
	)
	(text "TVT25751 x 3 (615 VDC, thermal link + monitor lead): MOV1 +/M, MOV2 -/M, MOV3 M/PE_T. Up,eff 3793 V pole-PE\nand pole-pole at In 3 kA (calc., <= 4.0 kV -> reinforced 6 kV / basic 4 kV, D-032); Imax 25 kA. Branch\nfuses ETI CH14x51 gPV 36 A 30 kA (L/R 2 ms). Monitor loop through both fuses and all three links -> CNY65B\n-> RB1 (sum on the ID line): RB1 = 1 at rest above 200 V = varistor network open -> CTRL inhibits/stops."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 123.276 154.564 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c076f3f-56d5-58a6-b143-f838a0d79694")
	)
	(text "PASSIVE BLEEDER + BOARD CONNECTION POINTS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175 264.784 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c229057-9ca8-5c46-b72a-3b0ae67a89a4")
	)
	(text "G7L-2A-X, poles in series, normal polarity = current 8 -> 2 (terminal -> bus). K_A_PRE feeds the coil\nand gates its IRFL214 low side; S2M + SMBJ33A across the coil (37-42 V, Omron p5). R_pre 220 ohm Miba\nRST 200 (RFQ, pulse-rated). Complete at |dV| <= 10 V after the VA/VAX null; abort below 0.8 x Vterm x\n(1-exp(-t/0.22 s)) or at 1.32 s; max 3 attempts, then 30 s lock-out (sim/port_design.py)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.18 230.164 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1050f408-186f-5b88-a025-9bac073c746b")
	)
	(text "HOLD-CLOSED POWER STAGE (2 INDEPENDENT CHANNELS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 167.064 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "23d10be3-8f88-5d08-bb18-9aee0d7e94d4")
	)
	(text "HVC43-250A-24MC, + pole, bidirectional (TDK p2). Opens at zero current in normal operation; cut-off\n450 A @ 1000 V once. K_A_MAIN feeds coil+ (S2M) AND gates the IRFL214 low side: two switches in the\npath. S10K30 directly across the coil = the only flyback path (>= 54 V down to drop-out; TDK p7 >= 50 V),\nV_DS <= 107 V. FB: NC mirror contact inverted by 1.5 k: FB_A_MAIN high = CLOSED (also feeds the TPSI EN OR).\nIC-05: coil + mirror contact to main >= 4400 V AC, Uimp 8 kV (HVC43MC p3): reinforced with the 6 kV credit\n(6.6 kV at 4000 m); insulation type not stated (TDK to confirm); coil/FB wiring >= 10 mm from the studs.\nPV-class port: no stiff source allowed (battery / DC bus = source battery)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 559.0728 95.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4bc34d35-34e6-5c4e-8a67-4cb11e28d398")
	)
	(text "TPSI3050 EN = K_DISCH OR FB_A_MAIN (2 x BAS16): powered = BSS138 holds the SiC gate low. Unpowered\n= the bus biases the gate (10 M, 15 V zener) -> 2 x 300 ohm Miba RST 200 discharge the bus. FB is high\nwhile the contactor is closed (or welded), so an E-stop or a lost K_DISCH cannot discharge a live port;\nFB keeps a running TPSI on, SYS energises K_DISCH first at power-up (27 mA start-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 497.604 252.284 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "57f0a170-067a-57d9-a26f-09651e7e13ef")
	)
	(text "10 x 47 k 2512 1 W (100 V each at 1000 V): back-up discharge, 2.4 W at 1000 V.\nREDCUBE studs: bus +/- to the power cells, terminal-side tap."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175 329.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ccd8b6a-1b0f-56cc-ac5b-7d7b6ae00efc")
	)
	(text "MOV3, Y capacitors and the IMD test strings return on PE_T: a removable\nM4 strap to chassis PE, opened for the hipot. Open strap = no IMD swing."
